\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The phases of the experiment set. Environments and iterations trade off to hold the total experience at about 23.8 million pushes for the Isaac Lab runs; the cross-environment runs instead use a fixed 3{,}000 iterations and a single seed, and vary the per-update batch through the environment count and the push length. The experiment set comprises 94 training runs in Isaac Lab and 10 in the second simulator.}}{36}{}\protected@file@percent }
